$MDESC::Type = "Team Deathmatch";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Team Deathmatch" @
	"\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Hepta Ourubis II" @
	"\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Sand storm in progress - low visibility" @
	"\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @
	"\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 4" @
	"\n\n<f1>Briefing: <f0> Kill or be killed.  Stay within the mission boundaries or die. Weapons, ammo, backpacks and repair kits are scattered among the ruins in this sand-blown desert world.  Due to a severe sandstorm, visibility is reduced to a few meters. Be wary -- the average lifespan of a tribesman is measured in seconds here.\n\n<f1>Edited by [HvC]NaTeDoGG for use with the HaVoC mod.\nhttp://havoc.sirris.com";